Description:

An admin can set the new ``/vendor/cmu/cyrus-imapd/accountid`` annotation on
a user's INBOX to choose the OBJECTID+ ACCOUNTID reported for all of that
user's mailboxes, for example to match the accountId a JMAP frontend uses.
Without it, the ACCOUNTID remains the userid.


Documentation:

The annotation list in docsrc/reference/faqs/o-annotations.rst.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

The value is kept in mailboxes.db and replicated with the INBOX, so upgrade
replicas before setting it: an older replica doesn't store it.


GitHub issue:

None.
